opengg (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of OpenGG.
  * SteelSeries GG style Qt 6 interface (Home, Engine, Sonar, Moments,
    Settings).
  * Apex 3 TKL: 8-zone illumination, software effects, brightness sync,
    idle dimming.
  * Rival 3 Wireless Gen 2: CPI presets, polling rate, button remapping,
    battery level.
  * udev rules, system tray, autostart, Turkish translation.

